---
title: Bacon and Asparagus Flan
description: A light filo pastry tart
servings: 6
course: Main
source: https://www.bbc.co.uk/food/recipes/egg_bacon_and_asparagus_32159
author: The Hairy Bikers
image: https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_1600/recipes/egg_bacon_and_asparagus_32159_16x9.jpg
prep time: 45m
cook time: 40m
locale: en_GB
difficulty: Medium
tags:
- main-course
